      "body": "Currently, we display the status (read/unread) of a message in 2 ways:\r\n\r\n- **UNREAD** badge  highlighted in yellow in the message tab\r\n- Unopened envelope icon on the right hand side of the message tab\r\n\r\nThe \"UNREAD\" badge is redundant and should be removed. It would be nice to take the same yellow color used for the \"UNREAD\" badge and use it for the unopened envelope icon. \r\n\r\n![Unread color](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/85491794/142912087-15c2fc56-b612-4bd8-aedf-d17ec07f51fd.png)\r\n\r\n\r\n",
